      <blockquote><p>Would it be worth to reference <a href="https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/00KZ">Lemma 10.5.4</a>? My understanding is that the filtration mentionned in 10.5.4 corresponds to the Fitting ideals and that the ideals <script type="math/tex">I_i</script> correspond to the invariant factors of the module (under the right assumptions). Maybe this could be done as an item of <a href="https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/07ZA">Lemma 07ZA</a>.</p></blockquote>
