      <blockquote><p>I think the filtration in Lemma <a href="/tag/00KZ" data-tag="00KZ">10.5.4</a> isn't enough pinned down to give a lot of control over the fitting ideals. Yes, there is a relation but it would be a pain to make explicit. Maybe you could write an example we could add?</p></blockquote>
